    "code": "/* Технология: Confetti Cannon Celebration Blast | Движок: Canvas 2D */\\n// Магнитный отклик, LERP-курсор и Ripple волны\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\nlet t = 0;\nfunction draw() {\n  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(5, 5, 10, 0.25)';\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n  t += 0.04;\n  const cx = canvas.width / 2, cy = canvas.height / 2;\n  const cursorX = cx + Math.cos(t) * 60;\n  const cursorY = cy + Math.sin(t * 1.5) * 45;\n  for (let r = 10; r < 90; r += 20) {\n    const wave = (r + t * 25) % 90;\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(cx, cy, wave, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(247, 37, 133, ${1 - wave / 90})`;\n    ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n    ctx.stroke();\n  }\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(cursorX, cursorY, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#00f5d4';\n  ctx.shadowColor = '#00f5d4';\n  ctx.shadowBlur = 12;\n  ctx.fill();\n  requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n}\ndraw();\nlog('UI Micro-interactions: LERP Magnetic Cursor & Wave Ripples.');"
